    "answer": "plan/project/schedule/scheme/program/programme",
    "mnemonic": "When you do a <kanji>drawing</kanji> of a <kanji>measurement</kanji> you want to do on the chalkboard, you're drawing up a <vocabulary>plan</vocabulary> for doing something. All things require some kind of measurement, so drawing that measurement up is your plan.",
